+  - `python3 core/bench/with_zmq/single/run_comparison.py --pattern PUBSUB --msg-sizes 64 --transport tcp,inproc --runs 1 --build-dir core/build --results-tag codex_20260328_pubsub_monitor_tracking_gate_rerun`
